{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/274399-dragon-blood-face-background","id":274399,"title":"Dragon-Blood Face background","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-06T19:42:56-07:00","id":274399,"title":"Dragon-Blood Face background","content":"I have the Anathema character generator and it mentions the Face Background, but does not say what supplement that Face is in. Can somebody tell me where it can be found? A brief summary would also be helpful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T19:51:41-07:00","id":274421,"title":"","content":"Face is in Scroll of the Monk, and represents a character's standing in the &quot;martial arts world.&quot; It's probably better just to use Influence/Contacts/Mentor to represent that instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T19:58:03-07:00","id":274423,"title":"","content":"Scroll of the Monk. Repeated in Scroll of Heroes.<br /> <br /> Basically it says how well known you are in the Martial Arts world.<br /> <br /> It very specifically does not have a matching 'Heel' background, that does exactly the same thing. You should also not permit your PCs to trade a Heel background for a Face background, or vice versa, without fighting at least one match, and giving at least one interview.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T19:58:37-07:00","id":274424,"title":"","content":"Unless you are just interested in the martial arts world. Face can be used to end a fight with other martial artists before it starts because they heard of you, but otherwise I haven't seen as much use for itas influence/contacts/or mentor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T20:41:01-07:00","id":274447,"title":"","content":"It's for a very specific kind of game: the concept of Face in the underground martial arts world is very thematic for a game like Legends of the Wulin, but extremely niche and usually a resource trap for vanilla Exalted. Despite having wuxia visual, and to a degree gameplay influences, Creation does not fill the role of a wuxia setting like Legends of the Wulin very well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T10:37:13-07:00","id":274839,"title":"","content":"Pssh, you guys just don't know all the fun we be having in my games with Face... basically it is as useful as your ST is willing to make it. It can allow you easy camaraderie with other martial artists it can be used as plot hooks when your face hits a certain level and other martial artists want to show they can beat you to raise their own Face. I personally like it as an ST because it gives me story hooks. <br /> <br /> That and I don't know of any games I have played where there wasn't a PC or adversary who was a martial artist. If an adversary has Face you can let your PCs roll lore with bonus dice equal to their Face to see if they have heard of him and maybe get some hints about his/her fighting style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Be more Zen","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3985-daedalus","name":"Daedalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3985_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T10:49:08-07:00","id":274848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daedalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/274399-dragon-blood-face-background?p=274839#post274839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it is as useful as your ST is willing to make it</div> </div> </div> </div>Much like everything else really.<br /> <br /> From an ST point of view, Face is a great background. It is very easy to make this background useful (so the player doesn't feel like they've wasted dots). It is very easy to stop it being too useful (it's basically impossible to min-max abuse). It can be very fun in a martial arts heavy game (which is why it's presented in SotM), You can still get mileage out of it in a regular game (as Daedalus says, what game doesn't have grapples? I mean, &quot;martial arts&quot;).<br /> <br /> From a player point of view, I'd sooner take Family. I have never taken Family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T10:50:34-07:00","id":274849,"title":"","content":"Basically Face comes down to flavor, and flavor shouldn't cost points.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T11:50:34-07:00","id":274896,"title":"","content":"I've found that flavoring Face whichever way you want can give it a nice touch and now represents something specific. I usually tag Face with one of the 25 abilities, such as Face(Martial Arts) or Face(Performance) or Face(Sail), it now represents how popular you are within a very specific kind of person, and I allow it at every game I ST.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T11:57:09-07:00","id":274899,"title":"","content":"I've only ever seen Face used once, when the Storyteller granted it for free to characters who defeated high profile opponents in single combat and established their reputation as a badass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T18:18:05-07:00","id":275085,"title":"","content":"Exalted has this problem where people come up with new backgrounds based on the desire to put mechanical focus on something that previously lacked it, or to demonstrate a slight variant of a concept covered by a previous background. As a result there are way, way too many social Backgrounds, many of which are very similar to one another. Face isn't the <i>worst</i> of these, but it's pretty weaksauce.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T21:16:37-07:00","id":275203,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for your help. <br /> <br /> I was actually thinking of making an Islesi musician with high (Performance, of course) Presence, Socialize, and Martial Arts. I am considering Swaying Grass Dance style with a pair of God Kicking Boots while Hearthstone Bracers add to Dodge and the Hearthstone could be a Jewel of Youthful Suppleness. Suggestions? Criticism?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T01:09:00-07:00","id":275246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>L'het'esh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/274399-dragon-blood-face-background?p=275203#post275203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you all for your help.<br /> <br /> I was actually thinking of making an Islesi musician with high (Performance, of course) Presence, Socialize, and Martial Arts. I am considering Swaying Grass Dance style with a pair of God Kicking Boots while Hearthstone Bracers add to Dodge and the Hearthstone could be a Jewel of Youthful Suppleness. Suggestions? Criticism?</div> </div> </div> </div>Swaying Grass Style is a good choice for a Performer/Martial Artist. Remember that you will need an allied musician, preferably one with Performance 5, to make full use out of the capstone. If your party includes a sorcerer, demon harpists are ideal for this.<br /> <br /> For your artifact selection, keep in mind that as per Scroll of Errata, equipment bonuses do not stack. Therefore the -1 Speed for your hearthstone bracers and jade God Kicking Boots are redundant. To remedy this, I suggest using one of the refined jade options from Oadenol's Codex, which do not enhance Speed but instead offer other bonuses. Black Jade is good for Defence, and can ameliorate the boots' poor Defence value if you want to invest in PDV. Red maximizes damage, which is otherwise probably your best option.<br /> <br /> However, also consider fighting with DB Performance Charms. They can be quite strong for ranged attacks (especially against creatures of darkness) and with the right Charm selection they can offer a stunt-upgraded PDV which is immune to external and internal penalties.<br /> <br /> Finally, look into some of the native DB martial arts Charms. The ones in the Charms chapter of MoEP Dragon-Blooded explicitly work in conjunction with any style, so you can use Dragon Claw Elemental Strike to supplement your God Kicking Boot attacks and Blade-Deflecting Palm to boost your PDV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 10-08-2014, 06:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T06:58:15-07:00","id":275437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/274399-dragon-blood-face-background?p=274896#post274896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've found that flavoring Face whichever way you want can give it a nice touch and now represents something specific. I usually tag Face with one of the 25 abilities, such as Face(Martial Arts) or Face(Performance) or Face(Sail), it now represents how popular you are within a very specific kind of person, and I allow it at every game I ST.</div> </div> </div> </div>How many dots of Face (Sail) does it take to launch a thousand ships?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","name":"Barefoot Monkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1551_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T14:24:04-07:00","id":275745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Barefoot Monkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/274399-dragon-blood-face-background?p=275437#post275437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How many dots of Face (Sail) does it take to launch a thousand ships?</div> </div> </div> </div>You've got it wrong, it's the other way around; How much Face (Sail) do you get for launching a thousand ships?<br /> <br /> Actually launching them requires the appropriate combination of Thrown and Athletics Charms, or Artillery-tagged Archery if you've got the right equipment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Aretii: &quot;As one of the players described it, 'After initiation, it was actually a relief seeing who had eyepatches or bandaged hands - you know what <i>they</i> sacrificed, instead of wondering what bits people cut out of their own souls to gain power.'&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/578-lord-sia","name":"Lord Sia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T14:31:22-07:00","id":275769,"title":"","content":"Obviously it's Face (Appearance) that launches a thousand ships, <i>gosh</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T06:20:50-07:00","id":278097,"title":"","content":"Surely Face (Appearance) is for Lunars only?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T14:30:48-07:00","id":281455,"title":"","content":"Well, originally, yes, but they are <i>Lunars</i>, so the Alchemicals get Face (Appearance+) which is the same but with some nifty extras where it really should be the other way around, and Solar(oids) get Face (Perfect Appearance) because they have to be the best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Aretii: &quot;As one of the players described it, 'After initiation, it was actually a relief seeing who had eyepatches or bandaged hands - you know what <i>they</i> sacrificed, instead of wondering what bits people cut out of their own souls to gain power.'&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/578-lord-sia","name":"Lord Sia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"240"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}